WEBVTT

1
00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:38.000
<b>After a long time,</b>

2
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:40.625
<b>Arjuna now speaks.</b>

3
00:00:40.625 --> 00:00:45.791
<b>He is curious about the effects of </b>
<b>"unwavering intellect" on a person.</b>

4
00:00:45.791 --> 00:00:47.500
<b>He asks:</b>

5
00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:48.958
<b>"O Keshava,</b>

6
00:00:48.958 --> 00:00:50.916
<b>The one who is Sthita-Prajna,</b>

7
00:00:50.916 --> 00:00:52.833
<b>steady in wisdom and established in Samadhi,</b>

8
00:00:52.833 --> 00:00:54.875
<b>what are the characteristics of him?</b>

9
00:00:54.875 --> 00:00:56.708
<b>How does he speak?</b>

10
00:00:56.708 --> 00:00:58.333
<b>How does he sit,</b>

11
00:00:58.333 --> 00:01:00.000
<b>and how does he walk?"</b>

12
00:01:04.916 --> 00:01:10.041
<b>In this verse, Arjuna uses the term </b>
<b>"Sthita-Prajna,"</b>

13
00:01:10.041 --> 00:01:12.458
<b>but its meaning is the same as</b>

14
00:01:12.458 --> 00:01:15.000
<b>"unwavering intellect."</b>

15
00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:15.625
<b>Now</b>

16
00:01:15.625 --> 00:01:17.333
<b>perhaps you'll say,</b>

17
00:01:17.333 --> 00:01:19.500
<b>what kind of questions are these</b>

18
00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:25.791
<b>surely a person of unwavering intellect speaks, </b>
<b>walks, and rises just like others?</b>

19
00:01:25.791 --> 00:01:29.875
<b>Understand the deeper meaning </b>
<b>behind each question:</b>

20
00:01:29.875 --> 00:01:32.750
<b>What are the special characteristics of </b>
<b>a person with unwavering intellect?</b>

21
00:01:32.750 --> 00:01:35.750
<b>Meaning, how can one recognize such a person?</b>

22
00:01:35.750 --> 00:01:37.375
<b>How does he speak?</b>

23
00:01:37.375 --> 00:01:38.000
<b>Meaning,</b>

24
00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:42.416
<b>how does he respond to life's events?</b>

25
00:01:42.416 --> 00:01:43.916
<b>How does he sit?</b>

26
00:01:43.916 --> 00:01:50.666
<b>Meaning, how does he maintain such control</b>
<b>over his senses to keep his intellect unwavering?</b>

27
00:01:50.666 --> 00:01:52.125
<b>How does he walk?</b>

28
00:01:52.125 --> 00:01:57.708
<b>Meaning, while performing actions, </b>
<b>how does he work with his senses?</b>

29
00:01:57.708 --> 00:02:00.875
<b>Arjuna himself is very unstable at this moment,</b>

30
00:02:00.875 --> 00:02:01.958
<b>anxious...</b>

31
00:02:01.958 --> 00:02:05.458
<b>so naturally, he's intensely curious to know</b>

32
00:02:05.458 --> 00:02:09.875
<b>what a person who is completely opposite</b>
<b>to this state would be like,</b>

33
00:02:09.875 --> 00:02:14.666
<b>how such a person manages to </b>
<b>control their senses and emotions?</b>

34
00:02:14.666 --> 00:02:18.291
<b>The rest of this second chapter, </b>
<b>in one way or another,</b>

35
00:02:18.291 --> 00:02:21.958
<b>is an answer to these curiosities of Arjuna.</b>

36
00:02:26.833 --> 00:02:32.708
<b>Here Arjuna asks many questions about </b>
<b>a person of unwavering intellect.</b>

37
00:02:32.708 --> 00:02:35.750
<b>He is very curious.</b>

38
00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:37.250
<b>Curiosity</b>

39
00:02:37.250 --> 00:02:40.750
<b>is one of life's important qualities.</b>

40
00:02:40.750 --> 00:02:51.125
<b>It reflects a person's life values, </b>
<b>aspirations, and priorities.</b>

41
00:02:51.125 --> 00:02:58.250
<b>A person valuing cultural diversity will be </b>
<b>curious about new languages and customs.</b>

42
00:02:58.250 --> 00:03:06.250
<b>And one valuing justice and equality will be</b>
<b>curious about human rights.</b>

43
00:03:06.250 --> 00:03:07.541
<b>Similarly,</b>

44
00:03:07.541 --> 00:03:13.375
<b>a person valuing personal growth </b>
<b>will be curious about spirituality.</b>

45
00:03:13.375 --> 00:03:15.250
<b>Just as Arjuna is</b>

46
00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:18.666
<b>curious about unwavering intellect.</b>

47
00:03:18.666 --> 00:03:22.791
<b>When curiosity is directed properly,</b>

48
00:03:22.791 --> 00:03:24.916
<b>it leads you to new questions,</b>

49
00:03:24.916 --> 00:03:26.291
<b>their answers,</b>

50
00:03:26.291 --> 00:03:31.916
<b>and ultimately to new and </b>
<b>invaluable treasures of knowledge.</b>

51
00:03:31.916 --> 00:03:35.125
<b>It improves life.</b>

52
00:03:35.125 --> 00:03:38.958
<b>Stay curious about good things.</b>

53
00:03:38.958 --> 00:03:39.958
<b>Like</b>

54
00:03:39.958 --> 00:03:46.458
<b>Arjuna, personal growth seems </b>
<b>to be one of your life values too.</b>

55
00:03:46.458 --> 00:03:51.625
<b>That's why you're reading and listening </b>
<b>to this Gita with such curiosity.</b>

56
00:03:51.625 --> 00:03:54.333
<b>I know this well.</b>

57
00:03:54.333 --> 00:03:57.166
<b>So maintain this curiosity.</b>

58
00:03:57.166 --> 00:04:02.291
<b>And I will keep showing the </b>
<b>right direction to your curiosity.</b>

59
00:04:02.291 --> 00:04:04.458
<b>Stay connected.</b>

60
00:04:09.208 --> 00:04:14.416
<b>From Arjuna's many questions, I can clearly see</b>

61
00:04:14.416 --> 00:04:21.416
<b>his growing curiosity about the </b>
<b>soul and unwavering intellect.</b>

62
00:04:21.416 --> 00:04:24.000
<b>This indicates the right path.</b>

63
00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:25.500
<b>Similarly friends,</b>

64
00:04:25.500 --> 00:04:26.958
<b>from someone's questions,</b>

65
00:04:26.958 --> 00:04:28.208
<b>their words,</b>

66
00:04:28.208 --> 00:04:31.541
<b>or even their silence</b>

67
00:04:31.541 --> 00:04:37.500
<b>you can assess their state of mind.</b>

68
00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:41.750
<b>If someone in the family, </b>
<b>contrary to their natural nature,</b>

69
00:04:41.750 --> 00:04:49.875
<b>becomes very quiet and withdrawn, </b>
<b>it reflects their inner state.</b>

70
00:04:49.875 --> 00:04:50.916
<b>Perhaps</b>

71
00:04:50.916 --> 00:04:53.875
<b>they're in some mental turmoil.</b>

72
00:04:53.875 --> 00:04:55.750
<b>Talk to them.</b>

73
00:04:55.750 --> 00:04:59.666
<b>Understand. Help</b>

74
00:04:59.666 --> 00:05:00.833
<b>Likewise,</b>

75
00:05:00.833 --> 00:05:04.875
<b>if someone suddenly becomes angry,</b>

76
00:05:04.875 --> 00:05:06.583
<b>it's possible</b>

77
00:05:06.583 --> 00:05:09.750
<b>that something is suppressed in their mind,</b>

78
00:05:09.750 --> 00:05:11.541
<b>something they want to say,</b>

79
00:05:11.541 --> 00:05:12.416
<b>but</b>

80
00:05:12.416 --> 00:05:18.125
<b>the stress of hiding it emerges as anger.</b>

81
00:05:18.125 --> 00:05:26.375
<b>They might need an emotional moment </b>
<b>where they can unburden themselves.</b>

82
00:05:26.375 --> 00:05:27.958
<b>And similarly</b>

83
00:05:27.958 --> 00:05:29.958
<b>in social life,</b>

84
00:05:29.958 --> 00:05:37.875
<b>someone's gratitude and humility </b>
<b>indicate that they're internally satisfied,</b>

85
00:05:37.875 --> 00:05:42.416
<b>and perhaps spiritually evolved too.</b>

86
00:05:42.416 --> 00:05:45.958
<b>This applies to you as well.</b>

87
00:05:45.958 --> 00:05:53.041
<b>Are you lately responding differently</b>
<b>from your natural nature?</b>

88
00:05:53.041 --> 00:05:54.458
<b>For example</b>

89
00:05:54.458 --> 00:05:57.291
<b>never used to get angry before,</b>

90
00:05:57.291 --> 00:06:02.041
<b>but now get angry at everything.</b>

91
00:06:02.041 --> 00:06:03.625
<b>Strange,</b>

92
00:06:03.625 --> 00:06:04.541
<b>but</b>

93
00:06:04.541 --> 00:06:10.541
<b>sometimes people don't recognize </b>
<b>such changes happening within themselves.</b>

94
00:06:10.541 --> 00:06:12.000
<b>Reflect upon this.</b>

95
00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:13.833
<b>External reactions</b>

96
00:06:13.833 --> 00:06:15.750
<b>are internal reflections.</b>

97
00:06:15.750 --> 00:06:19.583
<b>For others, and for you too.</b>

98
00:06:19.583 --> 00:06:23.291
<b>Try to recognize this.</b>

99
00:06:23.291 --> 00:06:25.166
<b>I am with you.</b>

100
00:06:29.416 --> 00:06:34.041
<b>"Your first impression is your last impression."</b>

101
00:06:34.041 --> 00:06:39.166
<b>This saying is very popular in professional life.</b>

102
00:06:39.166 --> 00:06:40.916
<b>In the present context,</b>

103
00:06:40.916 --> 00:06:47.125
<b>don't understand this from the </b>
<b>perspective of dress or appearance.</b>

104
00:06:47.125 --> 00:06:52.083
<b>Here, the indication is about </b>
<b>the image of one's external reactions.</b>

105
00:06:52.083 --> 00:07:00.791
<b>How a person reacts can</b>
<b>certainly assess their mental state.</b>

106
00:07:00.791 --> 00:07:04.458
<b>That's why in interviews for high positions,</b>

107
00:07:04.458 --> 00:07:07.791
<b>this question is constantly asked</b>

108
00:07:07.791 --> 00:07:13.875
<b>what would you do in an </b>
<b>extremely difficult situation?</b>

109
00:07:13.875 --> 00:07:21.750
<b>The interviewer tries to assess the </b>
<b>candidate's nature from their reaction.</b>

110
00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:23.166
<b>Moreover,</b>

111
00:07:23.166 --> 00:07:25.833
<b>you'll agree</b>

112
00:07:25.833 --> 00:07:30.708
<b>that sometimes after meeting someone,</b>
<b>just a brief conversation</b>

113
00:07:30.708 --> 00:07:33.250
<b>makes you impressed by them.</b>

114
00:07:33.250 --> 00:07:41.750
<b>Their demeanor and speech reflect a </b>
<b>different kind of confidence. </b>

115
00:07:41.750 --> 00:07:49.000
<b>An internally accomplished person </b>
<b>will never boast about themselves.</b>

116
00:07:49.000 --> 00:07:58.208
<b>That's why Arjuna wants to know what such </b>
<b>a person's external behavior would be like,</b>

117
00:07:58.208 --> 00:08:01.916
<b>so he can recognize them.</b>

118
00:08:01.916 --> 00:08:03.666
<b>But perhaps</b>

119
00:08:03.666 --> 00:08:10.166
<b>Arjuna is also trying to </b>
<b>envision himself in that form.</b>

120
00:08:10.166 --> 00:08:16.583
<b>This indicates that he too </b>
<b>desires to achieve that state.</b>

121
00:08:16.583 --> 00:08:21.666
<b>This can be assessed from his reaction.</b>

122
00:08:21.666 --> 00:08:26.000
<b>Never make your reactions false,</b>

123
00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:29.875
<b>but it's important to know</b>

124
00:08:29.875 --> 00:08:36.666
<b>that people definitely assess you </b>
<b>from your external reactions.</b>

125
00:08:36.666 --> 00:08:40.666
<b>You influence others through this.</b>

126
00:08:40.666 --> 00:08:43.625
<b>If you're in a leadership position,</b>

127
00:08:43.625 --> 00:08:50.500
<b>you'll agree this knowledge is essential.</b>

